OL,3,GNEWSA'Real life' family ghost story
OL,4,Ainspires 'nightmarish' new TV drama
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt first the isolation felt like
OL,7,Ffreedom, but the family claimed things
OL,8,Fbegan to happen around the house
OL,9,Fleading them to feel increasingly
OL,10,Fscared.
OL,12,FWriter and creator, Danny Robins, met
OL,13,FLiz who told him "her incredible
OL,14,Fstory", becoming a four-part series he
OL,15,Fbelieves will "really surprise people".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
